      "claim": "The closest-scoring analogue contains the same piperazine-pyridylmethyl motif as the query and showed a 5-fold brain:plasma exposure ratio, directly demonstrating that this motif can be associated with good CNS penetration.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
